              "driver config"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "await pipeline(src, transform, dst);",
            "Readable.from(items)",
            "  .map(fn, { concurrency: 5 });  // Node 18+"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Two knees to watch",
          "text": "Throughput plateaus while p99 latency and error rate climb — that's your N. And `items.map(...)` over a million rows builds a million closures before any limiting happens: stream or paginate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_title": "Pools, Limits, Unhandled Rejections",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Your app limit sits UNDER the tightest gate above.",
            "Pair limiting with retry + jitter and a circuit breaker.",
            "A limiter alone still hammers a failing dependency.",
            "Pick N from the downstream's documented limit, then tune."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Unhandled Rejection",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "= rejected promise with no handler by the checkpoint end.",
            "Node 15+ raises `uncaughtException`, then exits code 1.",
            "Older Node only printed a warning — habits lag behind."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Mode",
