            "  log.fatal(r); flush(); process.exit(1);",
            "});",
            "process.on('rejectionHandled', late);  // late catch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Last Resort Handlers",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`unhandledRejection` is for logging and shutdown only.",
            "Never for business recovery — you lost the context.",
            "`uncaughtException`: log, flush, exit. Never resume serving.",
            "`rejectionHandled` proves late attach is legal but risky."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
